[h1]Living Fellows 0.26.68[/h1]

[list]
[*]Expedition path searches can finish within their bounded allowance instead of being restarted after eight seconds without movement. Ordinary stalled movement still recovers automatically.
[*]Expanded driving diagnostics distinguish path planning, squad waits, car failures and crew health. The test observer reads action history without changing ownership and fails immediately if a crew member dies.
[*]Known issue: driving return safety remains unresolved. Blocked routes can leave the car and cargo away from camp, and a survival/medical interruption can unload the crew near danger. This update does not claim a completed driving acceptance pass.
[*]Includes the matching version 0.26.68 native bridge. Project Zomboid 42.21.0 and bridge protocol 42.21-isocompanion-24 are unchanged.
[/list]
